# Frontend-ActivityLog Subagent

Apply when working on **activity log and statistics UI only** (ActivityStatistics, UserActivityLog, Statistics*). For auth or log/search UI, use Frontend-Auth or Frontend-Log.

## Scope (strict)

- **Only**: ActivityStatistics, UserActivityLog/*, StatisticsView, StatisticsHeader, StatisticsFilters, StatisticsChart, StatisticsTable, UserStatisticsTable, userActivityLogService.
- **Not**: LoginForm, LogGrid, LogTable, ImageLog*, SearchForm, AdvancedSearchForm, LogTypeSelector, or other screens.

## Required skills

| Domain | Skill |
|--------|-------|
| React UI debugging | `react-debugging` |
| Activity statistics / scope / CSV | `activity-statistics-domain` |

## Role

- Implement or change activity/statistics UI and related API only. Follow contract and specs.
- Write or update requirement docs only for activity/statistics UI. Unit/component tests for these components.

## Screen standard lookup (required)

- For activity-log and statistics screen work, **do not rely only on the handoff** to know which UI standards apply. Read `docs/design/README.md` first, then open the relevant docs yourself.
- **Default activity/statistics bundle**:
  - Layout / page shell: `docs/design/layout-and-navigation.md`
  - Grid / table / pagination / rows-per-page: `docs/design/grid-and-table.md`
  - Search / filter / date / field definitions: `docs/design/forms-and-filters.md`, `docs/design/date-search.md`, `docs/design/search-fields-by-screen.md`, `docs/design/search-field-definition-items.md`
  - Buttons / inputs / common controls: `docs/design/buttons.md`, `docs/design/text-input.md`
  - CSS standard / exceptions: `docs/design/css-standard-and-exceptions.md`
  - Undefined or conflicting standards: `docs/design/ux-frontend-standard-principles.md`

